{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_23188","headline":"喜张十八博士除水部员外郎 · 白居易","name":"喜张十八博士除水部员外郎","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"老何殁後吟声绝，虽有郎官不爱诗。\n无复篇章传道路，空流风月在曹司。\n长嗟博士官犹屈，亦恐骚人道渐衰。\n今日闻君除水部，喜於身得省郎时。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_23188.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_23188","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}